From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 03:18:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/10] read_audio: prepare the speech provider before the
 first segment

SenseVoice refuses to transcribe until its model is downloaded and loaded,
which only the voice UI triggered. read_audio now starts or joins the
provider's preparation through the seam and waits for a ready state
(autoPrepare, prepareTimeoutMs).

